WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.968 --> 00:00:01.934
-Well, guys, it seems like

00:00:01.934 --> 00:00:03.000
there's so much going on
right now.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.534
Everyone's gearing up
for the midterms.

00:00:04.534 --> 00:00:06.968
The World Series is heating up.

00:00:06.968 --> 00:00:10.634
The top 10 songs in the country
are all by Taylor Swift.

00:00:10.634 --> 00:00:12.834
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:17.868
Also, Stouffer's is releasing
its own Bloody Mary mix

00:00:17.868 --> 00:00:19.534
that tastes like lasagna.

00:00:19.534 --> 00:00:20.834
There's a lot to go over.

00:00:20.834 --> 00:00:22.367
Let's just jump in,
cover it all at once.

00:00:22.367 --> 00:00:24.267
It's time for "News Smash."

00:00:24.267 --> 00:00:26.634
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:31.000
First up, the midterms.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:32.334
They're less than a week away.

00:00:32.334 --> 00:00:34.067
Republicans are trying
to win back control

00:00:34.067 --> 00:00:35.300
of the House and Senate,

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:37.534
while the Democrats
want to hold on to both.

00:00:37.534 --> 00:00:41.267
Two sides going head-to-head,
kind of like the World Series.

00:00:41.267 --> 00:00:44.267
Tonight was Game 4 between
the Phillies and the Astros.

00:00:44.267 --> 00:00:45.834
Both teams are doing
everything they can

00:00:45.834 --> 00:00:47.734
to prove that they're the best
in the country.

00:00:47.734 --> 00:00:50.234
Speaking of the best
in the country, Taylor Swift --

00:00:50.234 --> 00:00:52.734
She's the first artist

00:00:52.734 --> 00:00:56.467
to hold all top 10 spots
in the Billboard 100 at once.

00:00:56.467 --> 00:00:57.767
That must feel good.

00:00:57.767 --> 00:00:59.334
And if you want
to feel good, too,

00:00:59.334 --> 00:01:01.467
maybe don't try Stouffer's new

00:01:01.467 --> 00:01:03.834
lasagna-flavored
Bloody Mary mix.

00:01:03.834 --> 00:01:05.968
It's vodka mixed with lasagna

00:01:05.968 --> 00:01:08.334
topped with a rim
of shredded mozzarella.

00:01:08.334 --> 00:01:11.267
It's the perfect drink for
anyone who wants to black out

00:01:11.267 --> 00:01:13.534
and forget all about
the midterms.

00:01:13.534 --> 00:01:15.968
It's a stressful time.

00:01:15.968 --> 00:01:18.100
President Biden has been
touring the country

00:01:18.100 --> 00:01:19.834
trying to rally support
for Democrats,

00:01:19.834 --> 00:01:22.767
but the only tour most people
care about is Taylor's.

00:01:22.767 --> 00:01:26.534
She announced her Eras Tour
this week.

00:01:26.534 --> 00:01:27.901
Tickets aren't available yet,

00:01:27.901 --> 00:01:29.434
but Swifties
are losing their minds,

00:01:29.434 --> 00:01:30.634
foaming at the mouth,

00:01:30.634 --> 00:01:32.634
which are also side effects
when you drink

00:01:32.634 --> 00:01:35.734
Stouffer's lasagna-flavored
Bloody Mary mix.

00:01:35.734 --> 00:01:38.100
Look at this thing.
It's like a lasagna smoothie.

00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:39.767
It's like a V8 from hell.

00:01:39.767 --> 00:01:42.901
If you drink one of these,
you might get the runs.

00:01:42.901 --> 00:01:45.501
You need runs
if you want to win.

00:01:45.501 --> 00:01:47.501
Philly's going to go nuts
if they win, by the way.

00:01:47.501 --> 00:01:50.334
Police are already racing
to grease up light poles.

00:01:50.334 --> 00:01:53.300
Speaking of races and polls,
the midterms.

00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:57.300
Dr. Oz is running for office
in Pennsylvania,

00:01:57.300 --> 00:01:58.868
and you'll be
in a doctor's office

00:01:58.868 --> 00:02:01.234
after drinking
alcoholic lasagna.

00:02:01.234 --> 00:02:03.400
In conclusion, here we go.

00:02:03.400 --> 00:02:04.567
Time to vote.

00:02:04.567 --> 00:02:05.934
What a show.

00:02:05.934 --> 00:02:06.868
Just no.

00:02:06.868 --> 00:02:09.100
This has been a "News Smash."

00:02:09.100 --> 00:02:11.634
[ Cheers and applause ]

